{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04238","headline":"丹阳刺史挽词三首 二 · 骆宾王","name":"丹阳刺史挽词三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"恻怆恒山羽，留连棣萼篇。\n佳城非旧日，京兆即新阡。\n城郭三千岁，丘陵几万年。\n唯余松柏壠，朝夕起寒烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04238.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04238","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}